  "_readme": "Seeded truth for the fixtures. 'facts' are regular expressions run over LOOK.md, look.json and the text artifacts. 'needs' lists the tools or packages a fact depends on: empty means the standard library reaches it (bare tier). A fact whose tool is missing must appear as a Not-looked-at row with an install line. 'questions' are for the agent-level check (3 per type, known answers). Written from the generator's seeds, never from the tool's output.",
